' 来源：《详细设计说明书》1.1.2 需求规定（按功能点编写用例描述）
@startuml 总体用例图
title 总体用例图

left to right direction

actor 游客 as guest
actor 普通用户 as user

rectangle "单词记忆与竞技学习平台" {
  usecase "用户注册" as UC1
  usecase "用户登录" as UC2
  usecase "用户退出" as UC3
  usecase "学习模式答题" as UC4
  usecase "复习模式答题" as UC5
  usecase "标记为不熟练" as UC6
  usecase "自定义词库管理" as UC7
  usecase "查看自定义单词" as UC71
  usecase "CSV 导入单词" as UC72
  usecase "删除自定义单词" as UC73
  usecase "查看排行榜" as UC8
  usecase "点赞" as UC9
}

guest --> UC1
guest --> UC2

user --> UC3
user --> UC4
user --> UC5
user --> UC6
user --> UC7
user --> UC8
user --> UC9

UC7 ..> UC71 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC72 : <<include>>
UC7 ..> UC73 : <<include>>

note bottom of user
  普通用户的所有用例前置条件为「已登录」，
  由 LoginInterceptor 统一保证
end note
@enduml
